   <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/cpmp-design-modules/evidenceText> "have a history of allergic reactions to monoclonal antibodies, or clinically significant multiple or severe drug allergies, including but not limited to erythema multiforme major, linear immunoglobulin A dermatosis, toxic epidermal necrolysis, or exfoliative dermatitis."
 ] .

[ rdf:type owl:Axiom ;
   owl:annotatedSource <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/cpmp-design-modules/ISA_NP01> ;
