   <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/cpmp-design-modules/evidencePage> 20 ;
   <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/cpmp-design-modules/evidenceText> "have a QRS interval ≥120 msec at Visit 1 or Visit 2"
 ] .

